# Steps from the title screen into a multiplayer match.
#
#   <key> <holdMs> <waitMs>
#
# NEEDS CALIBRATION. These are a starting point, not a working sequence - the
# real keypresses cannot be derived without watching the menus, and pretending
# otherwise would make this look tested when it is not. Run warm-body.ps1 with
# -DryRun to see the sequence, then fix the steps against what you actually see
# and time the waits generously; menu transitions here are slow.
#
# Keys available: W A S D Space Shift Ctrl E Q F Esc Enter Tab Up Down Left Right

Enter   80  6000    # dismiss the intro / press any key
Enter   80  4000    # main menu: first entry
Down    80   600    # move to MULTIPLAYER
Enter   80  8000    # enter multiplayer, waits on the server handshake
Enter   80  6000    # first playlist entry
Enter   80 20000    # confirm and sit in matchmaking
